WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.990
Before a long drive, the advice
is to check your tyre pressure.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.650
At the start of the
journey, not at the end.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.290
It's the same tyre.

4
00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.690
So why does the timing matter?

5
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.950
Why should drivers check tyre pressure
before a long drive, not after?

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.750
In this mission, you'll
find out how the pressure,

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.230
volume and temperature of a gas are linked,
and why the temperature must be in kelvin.

8
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:30.010
You'll use the ideal gas equation and the combined gas
law to predict what happens when conditions change.

9
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:35.000
Your mission: explain why tyre pressure
should be checked before a long drive.
